# Generated by tools/gen-plays.mjs: every Learn lesson on a phone (touch),
# from All Modes → Learn, each lesson played by touching the board mirror's
# cells (the required cell, else an Expert search's) to its Lesson Complete
# sheet and on to the next; the last one's Start playing goes to the modes.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Three Marks
frames 60
touch All Modes. Learn
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
touch Learn. Interactive
until 300 Short interactive lessons
frames 10
save tm-phone-lessons
touch Making a Mark
until 600 =Your move
frames 40
touch =Row 2, column 2: empty, available
frames 10
until 600 =Your move
frames 40
touch =Row 2, column 2: empty, available
frames 10
until 900 =Lesson Complete
frames 20
save tm-phone-lesson-done
